{"id":23055,"name":"献给明日的色彩","rarity":5,"path":"Elation","desc":"欢愉命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「错笔已修正，参数已调整。」</i>\\n她曾试图拟合画作中海的曲线，萃取水的形意，解析星星点点的浮沫。\\n一次又一次，绘笔下开出无数朵浪花，但都不是她想象中的那朵。\\n\\n<i>「我想为众人作画：并非描摹他们的脚步，而是为他们绘出前路。」</i>\\n一笔挥出，她为饥渴的孩子带去庇护。\\n墨色晕染，她用笔触织补天地的裂缝。\\n而她最遥远的一笔，穿透此世的画布，延伸向浩渺银河。\\n\\n无数个昨日，她为他人描绘未来——\\n苍白的，黯淡的，染上希望的色彩。\\n恍然回首，她落下的每一笔，也刻画着她心中的「真珠」。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23055,"name":"挥墨","desc":"使装备者的防御力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者对我方全体施放欢愉技时，使敌方全体受到的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>，持续<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>回合，为装备者固定恢复<unbreak>#2[i]</unbreak>点能量，并为我方全体回复等同于装备者防御力<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#5[i]%</unbreak></color>的生命值。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.48,10,3,0.22,0.1]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.6,10,3,0.275,0.125]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.72,10,3,0.33,0.15]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.84,10,3,0.385,0.175]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.96,10,3,0.44,0.2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":27,"defence_add":4.05,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":59.4,"defence_add":4.05,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110261,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":102.6,"defence_add":4.05,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110262,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":145.8,"defence_add":4.05,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110262,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":189,"defence_add":4.05,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID